Raon-1-mini local Transformers 5 port for GPT-QModel

Adapted from KRAFTON/Raon-1-mini-preview at
1b4f494d71dff50318288309f64c72aa8c11340e:
https://huggingface.co/KRAFTON/Raon-1-mini-preview/tree/1b4f494d71dff50318288309f64c72aa8c11340e

The upstream configuration, modeling implementation and tokenizer assets are
licensed under Apache License 2.0. The unmodified upstream LICENSE is included.
source_manifest.json records independently downloaded source/asset/header hashes.

Modified for package-owned Transformers 5.23 configuration/model/tokenizer
selection, native masking/generation APIs, portable per-projection MXFP8
expansion without persistent dense storage, strict source FP32 controls,
cache validation, reset and package-local imports. No checkpoint Python is
downloaded or executed at runtime. Upstream optional CUDA/FLA/Blackwell paths and
process-global MXFP8 quantizer monkeypatches are not shipped by this port.

The compressed released tensor inventory, tokenizer and release metadata are
test/provenance fixtures, not trained model weight payloads. Tiny numerical
oracles are independently expressed equations; they do not qualify trained
checkpoint quality or GPU/native fused kernels.
